title: governed-llm-gateway
abstract: "A small internal LLM gateway: routes each request to the cheapest adequate model (Claude, Azure OpenAI, Mistral AI or a local open-weight model), masks personal data, enforces team budgets, produces chargeback reports and exposes Prometheus metrics."
